<!--
  SpotBugs + FindSecBugs baseline for CI (mvn -B compile spotbugs:check).
  Findings were triaged on 2026-09-30: docs/PLAN-001/TASK_3-7_sast_triage.md. New findings fail the check.
  Entries are per class + method + pattern, so the same pattern in new code is still reported.
  Remove an entry when the code is fixed; add one only with a reason in the triage document.
  Entries without a comment are code-quality findings (no security impact), left for later cleanup.
-->
